  "summary": "Sitting at the front edge of the carriage with the feet on the footbar in a small V and the spine rounded, press out, lower and lift the heels, and bend back in. Four versions get steadily harder.",
  "steps": [
    "Sit near the front edge of the carriage facing the footbar; balls of the feet on the bar, heels together, knees open.",
    "Hands on the front edge beside the hips; round the spine and scoop the belly.",
    "Breathe in to press out; lower and lift the heels.",
    "Breathe out to bend the knees and bring the carriage home."
  ],
